All done. Here's what was implemented and verified:

### Files Changed

**`app/auth.py`** — `require_api_key` now reads `X-API-Key` via `Header(default=None)`, returns 401 with `"Missing API key"` if absent or `"Invalid API key"` if not in `VALID_API_KEYS`, otherwise returns the username.

**`app/main.py`** — six changes:

| Endpoint | What changed |
|----------|-------------|
| `GET /tasks` | Added `status`, `priority`, `assigned_to` optional query params (combinable filtering); added `page` (default 1) and `page_size` (default 20, max 100) for pagination |
| `POST /tasks` | New — requires auth via `Depends(require_api_key)`, validates `project_id` exists (404), auto-generates ID via `_next_task_id()`, returns 201 |
| `PUT /tasks/{task_id}` | New — requires auth, partial update via `model_dump(exclude_unset=True)`, returns 404 if not found |
| `DELETE /tasks/{task_id}` | New — requires auth, removes from list, returns 204 (empty), 404 if not found |

### Verification

All 17 smoke tests passed: single/combined filtering, pagination boundaries, auth success/failure on all 3 auth-protected endpoints, 404 on missing project/task, partial update, delete-then-get-404, delete missing task.
